  {
    "levels": "60",
    "spec": "Enhancement",
    "variant": "vs-warlock",
    "note": "G16's first authored matchup list, and it exists because the shipped row cannot fire. Enhancement@60 carries `Tremor Totem {self is feared}`, and a fear is hard CC: the summon spell applies no STATE/SCHOOL/DISPEL/MECHANIC immunity, so it does not cancel the fear and CMaNGOS refuses it exactly as this engine does (SpellMgr.h:401-440 SpellCancelsAuraEffect; Spell.cpp:6065 CheckSpellCancelsAuraEffect). Measured: refused 'feared' x179 over 3 duels versus the warlock rung and cast zero times. A totem that breaks fear has to be DOWN BEFORE the fear lands, so this list drops the fear gate and puts Tremor above Strength of Earth for the one earth slot. The warlock is the matchup that earns it - Fear, Howl of Terror and Death Coil are three fears in one kit.",
